    "id": "1COVER-faq-official-policy-clai-108",
    "content": "### When does the Double Excess Apply With The Winter Sports Pack?\n\nIf you have a policy with the [Winter Sports Pack](https://www.1cover.com.au/ski-travel-insurance/) add-on, and your claim arises directly from you participating in winter sports activities, then a double excess will apply for claims under the following sections:\n\n- Overseas Emergency Medical & Hospital Expenses,\n\n- On Trip Cancellation Fees & Lost Deposits,\n\n- Additional Accommodation & Travel Expenses\n\nYou cannot pay to remove this excess.\n\nAnd if you want some insider advice [the best places to go skiing](https://www.1cover.com.au/ski-travel-insurance/ski-advice/), look no further than our in-depth [Guide to Your Best Skiing holiday](https://www.1cover.com.au/ski-travel-insurance/ski-advice/)\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.1cover.com.au/faqs/ski/double-excess/](https://www.1cover.com.au/faqs/ski/double-excess/)",
