    "id": "ACENDA-faq-official-policy-clai-3",
    "content": "### I want a Certificate of Currency\n\nFor most policies, you can generate a Certificate of Currency by visiting the documents section [online](https://my.acenda.com.au/documents) and selecting “Download” under Certificate of Currency.\n\nFor helping logging into the customer portal or to obtain your certificate of currency, please give us a call on [13 65 25](tel: 13 65 25) between 9am to 5pm (AEST/AEDT), Monday to Friday.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.acenda.com.au/support/customer](https://www.acenda.com.au/support/customer)",
