    "id": "BINGLE-faq-official-policy-clai-1",
    "content": "### Can I choose my own repairer? — Do I have to pay an excess for a broken windscreen?\n\nWe have an optional extra called [Windscreen and Window Glass Only Cover](https://www.bingle.com.au/comprehensive-car-insurance/windscreen-cover) that can be added to your [Comprehensive Car Insurance](https://www.bingle.com.au/comprehensive-car-insurance) policy. If you have this extra, you won't have to pay an excess if the only damage is to your car's window/windscreen/sunroof glass is broken and you make a claim.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.bingle.com.au/faqs](https://www.bingle.com.au/faqs)",
