    "id": "BINGLE-faq-official-policy-clai-30",
    "content": "### How can I add windscreen cover as an optional extra?\n\nYou can add [Windscreen and Glass cover](https://www.bingle.com.au/comprehensive-car-insurance/windscreen-cover) when you get a quote for Comprehensive Car Insurance (not available as an optional extra for Third Party Car Insurance). You can also add it to your existing car insurance policy by [logging in to self-service](https://www.bingle.com.au/mypolicy). Of course, you'll need to have the Windscreen and Window Glass only optional extra on your policy before any incident takes place, you can't add it after an event and have it cover you for that same event.\n\nOptional extras benefits are subject to the terms, conditions, limits, and exclusions of the insurance policy. Please refer to the ++[PDS](https://www.bingle.com.au/policy-documents)++ for more information.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.bingle.com.au/faqs](https://www.bingle.com.au/faqs)",
