    "id": "BINGLE-faq-official-policy-clai-9",
    "content": "### If my car is written off, what will happen?\n\nYou'll need to lodge a claim, and if we determine your car to be a total loss we will settle your claim by paying you a total loss payment. This will be based on your car's market value. If you have [New for Old](https://www.bingle.com.au/comprehensive-car-insurance/new-for-old.html) as an optional extra (available on Comprehensive Car Insurance policies if your car is 3 years old or less), we will replace your car with a brand new car of the same make and model (if available).\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.bingle.com.au/faqs](https://www.bingle.com.au/faqs)",
