    "id": "BINGLE-faq-official-policy-clai-12",
    "content": "### What excess will apply if I need to make a claim?\n\nThe standard excess applies to all claims unless otherwise stated in the PDS. Your excess can be found in your [Insurance Schedule](https://www.bingle.com.au/mypolicy).\n\nCompare our [Comprehensive Car Insurance](https://www.bingle.com.au/comprehensive-car-insurance) and [Third Party Property Damage Car Insurance](https://www.bingle.com.au/third-party-car-insurance) to see the different options. Read the [PDS](https://www.bingle.com.au/policy-documents) to see the different excesses that may apply if you need to make a claim.\n\nClaims Payment examples and information about Excesses can be found in the relevant Premiums, Excess and Claims Guide (PED) for that product.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.bingle.com.au/faqs](https://www.bingle.com.au/faqs)",
