    "id": "CHALLENGER-faq-official-policy-clai-32",
    "content": "### Can the unspent quarterly budget for ongoing services carryover to the following quarter?\n\nThe unspent budget for ongoing services will automatically carry over in the home support account to the next quarterly budget. The carryover amount will be capped at the higher of $1,000 or 10% of the quarterly budget for ongoing services.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.challenger.com.au/adviser/knowledge-hub/Articles/Home-care-reforms-FAQ](https://www.challenger.com.au/adviser/knowledge-hub/Articles/Home-care-reforms-FAQ)",
