    "content": "### How do I know if a product isn't appropriate for me?\n\nOur Target Market Determination (TMD) can help you decide if the product is appropriate. The TMD, along with the Product Disclosure Statement (PDS), your objectives, your financial situation and needs may help you determine whether a product is appropriate for you. A financial adviser can help you with this. You can obtain a copy of the relevant product’s TMD and PDS on our website. If you have questions regarding our products, please discuss this with your financial adviser, or call us on 13 35 66 (Australia only) between 8.00am and 6.00pm (Sydney time) Monday to Friday.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.challenger.com.au/individual/help-and-support/frequently-asked-questions](https://www.challenger.com.au/individual/help-and-support/frequently-asked-questions)",
