    "id": "CHALLENGER-faq-official-policy-clai-93",
    "content": "### What if I still want to apply for the product even though I'm not within the described target market in the TMD?\n\nOur Target Market Determination (TMD) can help you decide if the product is appropriate. If you’re not in the target market, it is likely that the product is not appropriate for you. You may still wish to apply for the product after considering the target market described within the TMD. Our products are not restricted to customers who only fit the target market in the relevant TMD. You should however consider the Product Disclosure Statement, your objectives, your financial situation and needs before deciding to invest in an annuity. A financial adviser can help you decide.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.challenger.com.au/individual/help-and-support/frequently-asked-questions](https://www.challenger.com.au/individual/help-and-support/frequently-asked-questions)",
