    "id": "HCF_LIFE-faq-official-policy-clai-4",
    "content": "### Do I need to provide personal medical information to take out a Recover Cover policy?\n\nWe’ll need some basic information like your age, weight and whether you smoke. For selected products including Life Protect Insurance and Critical Illness Insurance we will ask additional questions about your health and lifestyle, but we won’t require complex medical checks.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.hcf.com.au/insurance/life-recover-cover/faqs](https://www.hcf.com.au/insurance/life-recover-cover/faqs)",
