    "id": "HCF_LIFE-faq-official-policy-clai-9",
    "content": "### What is the waiting period? — How long is my benefit period? — What happens after 12 months? — Is there an age limit to apply for Income Protect Insurance? — Will I be covered overseas?\n\nYes, you'll be covered for any illness or injury that happens overseas which results in you being unable to work for more than 30 days. But the cover won't provide coverage for a loss of income from any occupation that you may have outside Australia or from an ineligible occupation. Claims must be made and will only be paid in Australia.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.hcf.com.au/insurance/life-recover-cover/faqs](https://www.hcf.com.au/insurance/life-recover-cover/faqs)",
