    "content": "### If my income changes, will this affect my eligible benefit amount? — Who's covered under Critical Illness Insurance (trauma insurance) and how much is the benefit amount under the policy?\n\nWho's covered under Critical Illness Insurance (trauma insurance) and how much is the benefit amount under the policy? Critical Illness Insurance is a single policy and covers the named policyholder. The benefit amount is paid to the insured person and depends on the level of cover chosen:\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.hcf.com.au/insurance/life-recover-cover/faqs](https://www.hcf.com.au/insurance/life-recover-cover/faqs)",
