    "id": "METLIFE-faq-official-policy-clai-5",
    "content": "### How many nominated beneficiaries can I have?\n\nYou can nominate up to five people to receive your death benefit if you die.\n\nTo nominate a beneficiary, go to the [Forms page,](https://www.metlife.com.au/get-help/documents-and-forms/) and download the Nomination of Beneficiaries form.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.metlife.com.au/resources/faqs](https://www.metlife.com.au/resources/faqs)",
