    "id": "NEOS-faq-official-policy-clai-6",
    "content": "### What is NEOS Protection?\n\nNEOS Protection is a highly-rated suite of life insurance cover types available as self-owned or superannuation owned plans that will meet the needs of the majority of clients, at very competitive prices. The cover types available under NEOS Protection include:\n\n| **Cover** | **Available as** | **Maximum sum insured at entry** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Life Cover | Stand-alone | $5,000,000 |\n| Total & Permanent Disability (TPD) Cover | Stand-alone Attached to Life Cover Linked to Life Cover Split | $3,000,000 |\n| Critical Illness Cover | Stand-alone Attached to Life Cover Linked to Life Cover | $1,000,000 |\n| Child Cover | Stand alone | $200,000 |\n| Income Support Cover | Stand-alone Split | $30,000 per month |\n\n[Learn more about NEOS Protection](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/about-neos-protection/)\n\nTags:\n[Product](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faq_category/product/)\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/)",
