    "id": "NEOS-faq-official-policy-clai-20",
    "content": "### What is total and permanent disability (TPD) cover?\n\nTPD cover provides a lump sum payment if the insured person becomes totally and permanently disabled. This money can be used to help pay medical expenses or cover the cost of necessary lifestyle changes.\n\nTags:\n[About life insurance](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faq_category/about-life-insurance/)\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/)",
