    "id": "NEOS-faq-official-policy-clai-21",
    "content": "### What is critical illness cover?\n\nCritical illness cover provides a lump sum payment if the insured person suffers critical illness. The money paid can be used for any purpose; whether it’s to seek specialised medical treatment, reduce debts or make necessary lifestyle changes.\n\nTags:\n[About life insurance](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faq_category/about-life-insurance/)\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/)",
