    "id": "NEOS-faq-official-policy-clai-1",
    "content": "### Can I access a copy of my claims file?\n\nIf you’ve made a claim, you can generally access all the information we hold about you, except for certain instances, as per privacy legislation, where we need to provide information directly to your doctor, instead of providing it directly to you.\n\nSimply call us on 1300 090 188 or email us at **[claims@neoslife.com.au](mailto:customerservice@neoslife.com.au)** and we’ll organise to send a copy of your claims file to you.\n\nTags:\n[Claims](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faq_category/claims/)\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/can-i-access-a-copy-of-my-claims-file/](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/can-i-access-a-copy-of-my-claims-file/)",
