    "id": "NEOS-faq-official-policy-clai-2",
    "content": "### Am I covered outside Australia? — Can I make changes to my plan once it’s set up?\n\nWe know that life is constantly changing, and you may need to make changes to your plan from time to time. In many cases, general plan alterations such as changes of address or bank account details can be completed over the phone. For more complex plan alterations, we may require additional information. Either way, simply call us on 1300 090 188 or email us at **[customerservice@neoslife.com.au](mailto:customerservice@neoslife.com.au)** and we’ll do our best to make the process easy for you.\n\nTags:\n[About my plan](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faq_category/about-my-plan/)\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/can-i-make-changes-to-my-plan-once-its-set-up/](https://www.neosprotect.com.au/faqs/can-i-make-changes-to-my-plan-once-its-set-up/)",
