    "id": "SHANNONS-faq-official-policy-clai-23",
    "content": "### What should I do if my food spoils following a blackout?\n\nWhen lodging a claim, just provide us with an estimated cost of how much food spoiled. Claims that only involve food spoilage are excess free. You can find out your policy limit for a food spoilage claim in your [PDS](/policy-documents \"\").\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.bingle.com.au/graphql/execute.json/aeminsuranceeds/FAQListSortable;tag=insurance](https://www.bingle.com.au/graphql/execute.json/aeminsuranceeds/FAQListSortable;tag=insurance)",
