    "id": "SHANNONS-faq-official-policy-clai-24",
    "content": "### What should I do if there is water leaking into my home following a severe weather event? — Why do I need flood cover when I'm not in a flood zone?\n\nAfter frequent unpredictable flooding in recent years, it's important that we provide you with flood cover even if it seems unlikely a flood will occur at your address.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.bingle.com.au/graphql/execute.json/aeminsuranceeds/FAQListSortable;tag=insurance](https://www.bingle.com.au/graphql/execute.json/aeminsuranceeds/FAQListSortable;tag=insurance)",
