    "id": "SHANNONS-faq-official-policy-clai-25",
    "content": "### Do I need home and contents insurance?\n\nWhether you need home and contents insurance depends on your personal circumstances, including whether you own or rent your home and the value of your belongings.\n\nWhile this type of insurance isn't compulsory, it help covers the financial impact of insured events such as storm, fire, flood, escape of liquid, earthquake, theft, vandalism.\n\nWithout cover, these costs would need to be paid out of your own pocket.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.bingle.com.au/graphql/execute.json/aeminsuranceeds/FAQListSortable;tag=insurance](https://www.bingle.com.au/graphql/execute.json/aeminsuranceeds/FAQListSortable;tag=insurance)",
