    "id": "SHANNONS-faq-official-policy-clai-43",
    "content": "### Will I get a hire car while my car is being repaired? — Are modifications covered on imported cars?\n\nYes, modifications can be covered by Shannons if they're listed and accepted on your policy.\n\nThis may include things like:\n\n* Performance upgrades\n* Cosmetic changes\n* Specialist parts\n\nBe sure to disclose all modifications when getting a quote to ensure they're included in your agreed value.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.bingle.com.au/graphql/execute.json/aeminsuranceeds/FAQListSortable;tag=insurance](https://www.bingle.com.au/graphql/execute.json/aeminsuranceeds/FAQListSortable;tag=insurance)",
