    "id": "SCTI-faq-official-policy-clai-1",
    "content": "### What is a Medical Only travel insurance?\n\nOur International Medical Only policy is a lower-cost alternative international travel insurance that provides cover for emergency medical treatment, accidental injury or unforeseen illness. It does not include other benefits usually found in a comprehensive policy such as trip cancellations or delays and lost or stolen luggage and personal effects.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://scti.com.au/faqs](https://scti.com.au/faqs)",
