    "id": "SCTI-faq-official-policy-clai-3",
    "content": "### How do I make a claim?\n\nClick ‘Make a claim’. Log in with your policy number and email used when purchasing the policy. A 6-digit verification code will be sent to your email address. Once you have entered the verification code, click ‘Log In’. To make your claim, click ‘Initiate a New Claim’. Fill out the required details of the claim event and select the reasons for your claim from the displayed benefit options. Click ‘Next’. Follow through with the journey and enter all your claimed expenses individually. Attach relevant supporting documentation and upload. Click ‘Next’. Review your information and if it is all correct, click Next. Add your bank details and read both the Declaration and Privacy Act authorisation. If you agree, check each box and click ‘Submit’. You can also submit a claim by clicking on ‘Manage Claims’ in the blue bar at the top of your My SCTI dashboard and expand the side panel to find ‘Make a Claim’.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://scti.com.au/faqs](https://scti.com.au/faqs)",
