    "id": "SCTI-faq-official-policy-clai-8",
    "content": "### How do travel warnings affect whether I can buy a policy?\n\nWhen a country has a ‘Reconsider your need to travel’ or ‘Do not travel’ warning, we may decide to either: sell you a policy, and these will be highlighted on our website; or not sell you a policy – these destinations cannot be selected on our website. If you cannot select a country, it may mean we have removed the destination from our website due to the extreme risk that the destination poses to travellers.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://scti.com.au/faqs](https://scti.com.au/faqs)",
