    "content": "### What is a qualifying period for Total Permanent Disability (TPD)?\n\nWe can start assessing your TPD claim after you have been out of work for three months in a row. In some cases you may qualify immediately, such as due to blindness or loss of limb.\n\n*Canonical Source:* [https://www.tal.com.au/tools-and-faqs/insurance-faqs](https://www.tal.com.au/tools-and-faqs/insurance-faqs)",
